  "final_scope": [
    "All three target arms first pass the predefined per-task90percent train and85percent validation gates at recorded checkpoint80. Earlier unsaved crossings are unknown; no threshold-speedup claim.",
    "Learned source has an early advantage over untouched on validation and triples, but not over LoRA; learned and untouched first reach perfect triples and length4 at160, LoRA at80. Final320 alone hides later LoRA regression.",
    "Source transfer uses the actual jointly qualified heads_new_latents step512 with its learned ABC vectors frozen. The trained heads and task vectors change together, so their separate causal contributions are not identified.",
    "Nullspace sacrifices new-task heldout generalization for exact adapter conservation on four specified task vectors; both arms acquire and both pass the looser behavioral net-drop tolerance.",
    "Preservation reduces mean squared normalized matrix drift94.237percent and retains98/99 previously correct answers versus95/99 control, with fewer newly corrected answers. It is regularization, not exact conservation.",
    "Source tests cover one synthetic ABC stream and128 released-task probes. TargetWinoGrande starts19/32 below the60percent ability gate; only the other three target tasks qualify. All target initial adapter gains are zero because alignment output starts at zero.",
    "Scoring is the declared character-normalized four-choice answer contract. No free-generation, unfamiliar related-skill, longer-stream, repeated-upgrade, multiple-seed reliability, or general continual-learning claim.",
    "Native target calibration trains10486912 parameters versus2949120 LoRA parameters. Learned-source pretraining512updates is additional history; no end-to-end efficiency advantage is established.",
    "Methods are native-adapter distillation/retention regularization and a frozen-feature head constraint. These are not reproductions of NestedLearning, Agent-Dice, LoRAGen or fullAlphaEdit.",
    "Behavioral checks independently rederive stored scores; collected adapter and optimizer tensors were loaded locally. Frozen-base/reload identity is tied to hashed runtime receipts; full base inference was not repeated locally."
  ],
